              "raw_note": "亮及倫別有傳亮上原衍「汝南王亮」四字，今從吳本。",
              "raw_note_sha256": "56487327592265c4717f825e825622e65455e9ec5597a1949119d7ec9afcae6d",
              "collated_by_current_agent": false
            }
